				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p><strong>Knossos Tour:</strong> Knossos is a Bronze Age archaeological site in Crete. The site was a major center of the Minoan civilization and is known for its association with the Greek myth of Theseus and the minotaur. It is located on the outskirts of Heraklion, and remains a popular tourist destination.</p>						</div>
				</div>
